<title>CHILE: O'Higgins Jan-Sept 16.1 bln pesos net.</title>
<headline>O'Higgins Jan-Sept 16.1 bln pesos net.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco O'Higgins reported 16.1 billion pesos net in the first nine months of the year, compared to 12.7 pesos in the same period last year.</p>
<p>The figures were reported by the Superintendency of Banks and Financial Institutions.</p>
<p>The superintendency reported the bank's capital and reserves at 133 million pesos and outstanding loans at 1.46 billion pesos.</p>
<p>-- Roger Atwood, Santiago newsroom +56-2-699-5595 x211</p>
